{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":15,"ref":"2-kings 10:15","book":"2-kings","lang":"id","chapter":10,"translation":"Dan ⟨ia⟩ berangkat dari sana, dan bertemu ⟨dengan⟩ ⟨את⟩ Yehonadav bin Rekhav untuk menemuinya; dan ⟨ia⟩ memberkati dia, dan berkata kepadanya, “Apakah ada ⟨את⟩ hatimu lurus seperti hatiku bersama hatimu?” Dan Yehonadav berkata, “Ada, dan ada.” ⟨Ia berkata,⟩ “Berikan ⟨את⟩ tanganmu!” Dan ⟨ia⟩ memberikan tangannya, dan ⟨ia⟩ menaikkannya kepada dirinya ke ⟨dalam⟩ kereta itu.","tokens":[{"surface":"וילך","gloss":"Dan berangkat"},{"surface":"משם","gloss":"dari sana"},{"surface":"וימצא","gloss":"dan bertemu"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"Yehonadav"},{"surface":"יהונדב","gloss":"Yehonadav"},{"surface":"בן","gloss":"bin"},{"surface":"רכב","gloss":"Rekhav"},{"surface":"לקראתו","gloss":"untuk menemuinya"},{"surface":"ויברכהו","gloss":"dan memberkati dia"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"dan berkata"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"kepadanya"},{"surface":"היש","gloss":"apakah ada"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"hatimu"},{"surface":"לבבך","gloss":"hatimu"},{"surface":"ישר","gloss":"lurus"},{"surface":"כאשר","gloss":"seperti"},{"surface":"לבבי","gloss":"hatiku"},{"surface":"עם","gloss":"bersama"},{"surface":"לבבך","gloss":"hatimu"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"dan berkata"},{"surface":"יהונדב","gloss":"Yehonadav"},{"surface":"יש","gloss":"ada"},{"surface":"ויש","gloss":"dan ada"},{"surface":"תנה","gloss":"berikan"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"tanganmu"},{"surface":"ידך","gloss":"tanganmu"},{"surface":"ויתן","gloss":"dan memberikan"},{"surface":"ידו","gloss":"tangannya"},{"surface":"ויעלהו","gloss":"dan menaikkannya"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"kepada dirinya"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"ke"},{"surface":"המרכבה","gloss":"kereta itu"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-08T08:10:58.235347201Z","model":"glm-5.2"}